soc: qcom: pd-mapper: add the SM8150 sensor DSP's protection domains

The SM8150 table lists the ADSP, CDSP and modem domains but not the SLPI's,
so the sensor DSP's root and sensor domains were never announced. SM8250's
entries (instance 90) apply unchanged.

--- a/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c
@@ -504,6 +504,8 @@
 	&cdsp_root_pd,
 	&mpss_root_pd_gps,
 	&mpss_wlan_pd,
+	&slpi_root_pd,
+	&slpi_sensor_pd,
 	NULL,
 };
 
